OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FAfter mounting calls for an external
OL,7,Finvestigation into the Chief Executive
OL,8,Fof the Law Society, UTV can reveal
OL,9,Fthat one was carried out.
OL,11,FThe society only revealed it to their
OL,12,Fmembers on Thursday afternoon.
OL,14,FDavid Lavery has come under scrutiny
OL,15,Ffrom both lawyers and the public,
OL,16,Fafter he provided a character
OL,17,Freference for his convicted paedophile
OL,18,Fcousin.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
