OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FWilliam Lloyd-Lavery, 77, of Richmond
OL,7,FAvenue in Lisburn, was sentenced to
OL,8,Ftwo years in prison after being found
OL,9,Fguilty of six counts of indecent
OL,10,Fassault at a school he taught at in
OL,11,Fthe 1970s.
OL,13,FDavid Lavery previously apologised,
OL,14,Ffor what he called a "serious error in
OL,15,Fjudgement" and to the victims for "any
OL,16,Fhurt and distress".
OL,18,FIn a letter seen by UTV, it stated
OL,19,Fthere was an independent "fact-finding
OL,20,Finvestigation" into his actions
OL,21,Fcarried out by a retired senior judge.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FVictims campaigner Margaret McGuckin
OL,7,Fsaid she fears his actions will deter
OL,8,Ffuture victims of sexual abuse from
OL,9,Fcoming forward.
OL,11,F"He needs to be ashamed of himself.
OL,12,FYou know, it has rocked the whole
OL,13,Fsystem. I've never heard a story like
OL,14,Fit.
OL,16,F"It is a conflict of interest, and a
OL,17,Fbig one at that. So many victims now
OL,18,Fwill not come forward when you've got
OL,19,Fthe head of the Law Society standing
OL,20,Fby a a convicted paedophile. It's
OL,21,Foutrageous."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
