OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FSecretary of State Chris Bryant
OL,7,Fremoved the prominent legal figure
OL,8,Ffrom the Human Rights Commission over
OL,9,Fa week ago.
OL,11,FDavid Lavery remained as Chief
OL,12,FExecutive of the Law Society on
OL,13,FThursday evening despite growing calls
OL,14,Ffor his resignation.
OL,16,FLast week, the Law Society said they
OL,17,Fregretted the "distress and trauma"
OL,18,Fcaused to victims of William Lloyd
OL,19,FLavery and said they were "deeply
OL,20,Fsorry if the Society has in any way
OL,21,Fcompounded their pain".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,F"The Law Society has conducted an
OL,7,Finternal process and for reasons of
OL,8,Fconfidentiality, we are limited in
OL,9,Fwhat we can say publicly."
OL,11,FSince then, its members, victims, and
OL,12,Fthe public called for transparency
OL,13,Fover the internal process and called
OL,14,Ffor an independent investigation to
OL,15,Ftake place.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, a letter sent to members
OL,18,Fby the President of the Law Society,
OL,19,FMark Borland, was seen by UTV.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FIt said: "The Society has reflected
OL,7,Fcarefully on that feedback and accepts
OL,8,Fthat it should have been more
OL,9,Ftransparent in its communication with
OL,10,Fmembers."
OL,12,F"The Society recognises that it has
OL,13,Fmade mistakes in the handling of these
OL,14,Fissues and that many members remain
OL,15,Fconcerned and dissatisfied.
OL,17,F"I regret that and want to assure
OL,18,Fmembers that the Society is committed
OL,19,Fto listening, learning and taking the
OL,20,Fsteps necessary to restore confidence
OL,21,Fin its governance and leadership."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,FAnother letter signed by 50 members of
OL,7,Fthe Law Society has prompted a Special
OL,8,FGeneral Meeting to be scheduled for
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FJonathan McKeown, who is a member of
OL,12,Fthe Law Society, said: "I think any
OL,13,Fattempt by the society to restrict
OL,14,Fwhat happens at the special general
OL,15,Fmeeting to try to deflect from the
OL,16,Fmotions that are there, I think will
OL,17,Fcause consternation among the
OL,18,Fmembership.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,F"But we've also got to remember, in
OL,7,Fall of this, is the public want to
OL,8,Fknow. And how are we going to reassure
OL,9,Fthe public? And I'm reading that email
OL,10,Ffrom the from the Law Society
OL,11,FPresident today, and I'm just
OL,12,Fthinking, this is just a bigger hole
OL,13,Fbeing dug."
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the Law Society
OL,16,Fsaid that their "internal process
OL,17,Fcomprised the independent fact finding
OL,18,Finvestigation by a senior retired
OL,19,Fjudge".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
