OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786648716
OL,3,CLaw Society conducts independent
OL,4,Cinvestigation into Chief Executive
OL,6,F"Following its completion, the Law
OL,7,FSociety Council delegated authority to
OL,8,Fa panel to take forward a formal
OL,9,Fprocess.
OL,11,F"The panel had the final decision
OL,12,Fmaking authority in relation to the
OL,13,FChief Executive."
